.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE ANNOUNCEMENT DRAFT GENERATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik release announcement draft generate \- Generate or refresh the announcement draft from release scope
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release announcement draft generate [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate or refresh the announcement draft from release scope
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I RELEASE_ID
Release version id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --revision
Generate from this release revision instead of the current one
.TP
.B --confirm-replace-organization
Confirm replacing a draft generated from a different Organization view
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
